          "message": "[bzl gen] buildfmt merged output\n\nSummary: Some BUILD.in files may have out of order lists that are in the sortable allow list. This results in a mismatch between bzl gen output and arc lint. Adding a block to sort the final merged output for BUILD files via buildfmt will ensure that gen output is properly sorted.\n\nTest Plan:\n`BZL_DONT_USE_SQPKG=1 bzl gen //metaserver/tests/search_integration_tests` outputs a diff of:\n\n```\ndiff --git a/metaserver/tests/search_integration_tests/BUILD b/metaserver/tests/search_integration_tests/BUILD\nindex 2557f9ee2eeb..55f180c6689d 100644\n--- a/metaserver/tests/search_integration_tests/BUILD\n+++ b/metaserver/tests/search_integration_tests/BUILD\n@@ -84,9 +84,9 @@ dbx_slow_atlas_metaserver_http_test(\n     name = \"sharing_integration_tests\",\n     srcs = [\"sharing_integration_tests.py\"],\n     atlas_servicers = [\n-        \"//atlas/web_auth:web_auth_servicer\",\n         \"//atlas/sharing/controllers:shared_content_link\",\n         \"//atlas/sharing/controllers/api_v2:shared_links_servicer\",\n+        \"//atlas/web_auth:web_auth_servicer\",\n     ],\n     services = [\n         \"//atlas/fs_mount_transition:test_service\",\n```\n\nGitOrigin-RevId: 285fbea059c538d5d46f12a7cc718517af52ff6c",
