          "message": "[Bzl Gen] Allow dbx_go_test to use the go_versions attribute\n\nSummary:\nThis diff allows the usage of `go_versions` for `dbx_go_test` rules.\nThe reason is that some tests have deps that are incompatible with\nGo 1.18, but if we upgrade them they become incompatible with Go\n1.16. Therefore, we need to add the ability to have the tests\nrunning under one version of Go.\n\nTest Plan:\nRun `BZL_DONT_USE_SQPKG=1 bzl gen //foo` and observe that\nthe generator fails if I set `go_versions` for a dbx_go_binary, but\nsucceeds if I set `go_versions` for a dbx_go_test.\n\nGitOrigin-RevId: e77ce8cf85e3154530edcd1f55979742745bb2a9",
